          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP191 - Hinton

Posted: N53 23.864 W117 36.565

MyGPSr: N53 23.863 W117 36.565&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Found the orange metal guard post in the thick brush. The cap was in the obvious hole about 1 foot in front of the post and 12 inches below ground level. Thanks for another cap.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="328143348">
          <groundspeak:date>2013-07-05T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="381001">Foster Bros</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP191 - Hinton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevation: 997masl&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I thought this one would be another quick stop and snap alongside the road but unfortunately it is deep inside a little snarl of bushes. Normally I wouldn't mind the bit of bushwhacking but with the pouring rain it meant all the trees were drenched and I got soaked getting to the cap. Another quick clean off and find though, which was a bonus as I wanted to minimize the amount of time my phone was exposed to the rain to take the picture. Thanks for another cap!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Older Foster Bro&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="319221680">
          <groundspeak:date>2013-06-01T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="836983">Coolcat21</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP191 Hinton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MyGPSr: N53 23.864 W117 36.567

Elevation: 983 m&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I parked close by and the GPSr took me on a bit of an arcing path around this one before I simply spied the marker post in the small bit of gnarly bush this cap lives in. After cleaning off a few dead leaves, the still dirty cap revealed itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="191907243">
          <groundspeak:date>2011-10-07T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="2500583">Count Smiley</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP191 HInton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7pm  Really starting to lose light early these days, had enough to make the find sans flashlight.  The flagging on the tree  was most helpful.  On the trip back to the hotel we dropped into the local humane shelter and got a tour of this wonderful facility - good work being done there.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="191906164">
          <groundspeak:date>2011-10-07T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
