          <groundspeak:finder id="228846">Mr. CanoeHead</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP191 Hinton

The nearby flagging was helpful for this one.  The sun was setting but we were well equipped with flash light and head lamp.  TFTCap&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
